in the defense area.</li><li>Integrated design of detection and warning, supports tweeter + strobe light, supports optional green laser dazzling, in order to warn intruding targets.</li><li>The whole machine is light in weight and small in size, easy to install and maintain, supports optional 4G/5G transmission and photovoltaic integrated station, significantly improving construction efficiency and reducing construction costs.</li><li>Quasi-spherical structure design, strong load capacity, fast rotation speed, better wind resistance and anti-shake performance, clearer imaging.</li></ul>"}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"specs","className":"detail-section","style":{"padding":"80px 0","backgroundColor":"#fff"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","style":{"textAlign":"center","marginBottom":"50px","fontSize":"3.6rem","fontWeight":700},"children":"Technical Specifications"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"border":"1px solid #eee","overflowX":"auto"},"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"spec-table","style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","minWidth":"600px"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"style":{"background":"#f4f7fa","color":"#333","borderBottom":"2px solid #315ba4"},"children":[["$","th",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","textAlign":"left","fontSize":"1.6rem","fontWeight":"bold"},"children":"Parameter"}],["$","th",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","textAlign":"left","fontSize":"1.6rem","fontWeight":"bold"},"children":"Description"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"style":{"background":"#fff","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Overall Performance"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"1. Target Recognition: Pedestrians, vehicles\n2. Scanning Range: 360° full coverage\n3. Recognition Distance: Pedestrian (RCS 0.5㎡) ≥500m, Vehicle (RCS 5㎡) ≥700m"}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"style":{"background":"#fafafa","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Radar"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"1. Radar Type: 1T8R FMCW\n2. Ranging Accuracy: ±0.75m\n3. Range Resolution: 1.5m\n4. Beam Width: Azimuth (-6dB): 360°, Elevation (-6dB): 13°\n5. Angle Measurement Accuracy: ±1°"}]]}],["$","tr","2",{"style":{"background":"#fff","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"HD Visible Light"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"1. Working Distance: Medium vehicle (4.6m×2.3m): 7000m, Standing person (1.7m×0.5m): 5000m\n2. Sensor: Back-illuminated starlight-grade CMOS\n3. Resolution: 1920×1080\n4. Illumination: Color 0.01Lux, B/W 0.001Lux\n5. Lens Focal Length: 7mm～300mm 43x optical zoom, 16x digital zoom focus control: manual/auto focus"}]]}],["$","tr","3",{"style":{"background":"#fafafa","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Laser Illumination"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"1. Illumination Distance: 300m\n2. Laser Type: New HD floodlight homogenized light source, no speckle particles\n3. Illumination Angle: 1°～20°"}]]}],["$","tr","4",{"style":{"background":"#fff","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Sound and Light Warning"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Built-in integrated tweeter + strobe light, supports custom alarm sound, supports replacing with green laser dazzling"}]]}],["$","tr","5",{"style":{"background":"#fafafa","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Camera PTZ"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"1. Rotation Speed: Horizontal: 0.01°/s～180°/s; Tilt: 0.01°/s～120°/s, supports focal length adaptive speed\n2. Rotation Angle: Horizontal: 360° continuous rotation; Tilt: -90°～+90°\n3. Preset Cruise: 3000 presets, supports 16 cruise routes, each can support 256 presets"}]]}],["$","tr","6",{"style":{"background":"#fff","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Intelligence"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"1. Intelligent Analysis: Supports region intrusion detection, tripwire intrusion detection, motion detection, cruise detection as well as loitering detection, gathering detection, stay detection, reverse direction detection, etc.\n2. Auto Tracking: Supports multi-scene tracking, alarm linkage tracking"}]]}],["$","tr","7",{"style":{"background":"#fafafa","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Interface Protocol"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"1. Communication and Control: RJ45 / dual LC fiber cascade"}]]}],["$","tr","8",{"style":{"background":"#fff","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Power Supply"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"1. Power Supply Range: AC220V±20%\n2. Peak Power Consumption: ≤160W"}